{"id":"n62471-2-10","stage":1,"title":"길이 · 长度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62471-2-10-1","ko":"일 년의 길이는 얼마나 돼요?","zh":"一年的长度是多久呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년의","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길이는","meaning":"长度，长短","explanation":"길이：长度，长短；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62471","senseId":"2","lemma":"길이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"为","explanation":"되다：为；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31523","definition":"数数时第一个数目。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"75aba55303fbffdf","term":"길이","zh":"长度，长短","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3","entryId":"62471","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["기리"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个对象的数量、费用等是多少，或地点是什么地方。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ddf696abec930588d9b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62471-2-10-2","ko":"날짜로 따지면 일 년의 길이는 삼백육십오 일이 되지.","zh":"按天数算的话，一年有三百六十五天。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날짜로","meaning":"日子，时日","explanation":"날짜：日子，时日；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"날짜","audio":"/audio/09f76a1b7a6712eeafef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58157","senseId":"1","lemma":"날짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따지면","meaning":"计算，计较","explanation":"따지다：计算，计较；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"따지다","audio":"/audio/ba988072852aef793f83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50534","senseId":"5","lemma":"따지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년의","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길이는","meaning":"长度，长短","explanation":"길이：长度，长短；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62471","senseId":"2","lemma":"길이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼백육십오","meaning":"300（汉字数词）；65（汉字数词）","explanation":"삼백：300（汉字数词）；육십오：65（汉字数词）","readings":[{"term":"삼백육십오","audio":"/audio/9fbc9110e2deb8ab8e83.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"日","explanation":"일：日；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62598","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"